import LRA.NumberSystems.RealNumbers.Constructions.EffectiveCauchy.Laws

namespace LRA.NumberSystems.RealNumbers.EffectiveCauchy

/-!
This package deliberately makes no countability claim. Its approximation and
modulus functions are arbitrary Lean functions equipped with mathematical
modulus laws; no computability predicate or program-code semantics currently
exists in the repository.

A future computable-real package should require genuinely computable
approximation and modulus data and may then prove countability from a countable
coding of programs.
-/

end LRA.NumberSystems.RealNumbers.EffectiveCauchy
